    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Rights held by a person as nominee for another shall be treated as held by the other"

§§ `Rights attached to shares held by way of security (para 8) and rights attributed to a parent undertaking (para 9)`

-- src:19623 | (3) For the purposes of paragraph 8 rights shall be treated as being exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of an undertaking if they are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of or, as the case may be, in the interests of any group undertaking.
@ref sch 7 para 9(3) Instructions or interests of a group undertaking (src:19623)
GIVEN `the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, that undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 1161(5) the undertaking is a group undertaking in relation to the other undertaking` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 7 para 9(3) the rights are treated as exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of the undertaking` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, that undertaking`)
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "rights shall be treated as being exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of an undertaking if they are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of or, as the case may be, in the interests of any group undertaking" (an unmet "if"; marginal reading (a))
    ELSE CONSIDER `s 1161(5) the undertaking is a group undertaking in relation to the other undertaking`
         WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "any group undertaking" (the instructing undertaking is not a group undertaking: the answer of s 1161(5), supplied as an input; an unmet "if": marginal reading (a))
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the undertaking is a group undertaking is s 1161(5), a seam

-- src:19617 | 8 Rights attached to shares held by way of security shall be treated as held by the person providing the security—
-- src:19618 | (a) where apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with his instructions, and
-- src:19619 | (b) where the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities and apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in his interests.
@ref sch 7 para 8 Rights attached to shares held by way of security (src:19617-19619)
GIVEN `the shares are held by way of security` IS A BOOLEAN
      `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security` IS A BOOLEAN
      `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a group undertaking of the person providing the security` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security` IS A BOOLEAN
      `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the person providing the security` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 1161(5) the undertaking is a group undertaking in relation to the other undertaking` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 7 para 8 the rights are treated as held by the person providing the security` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the shares are held by way of security`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Rights attached to shares held by way of security shall be treated as held by the person providing the security"
    ELSE IF       `the instructions limb`
              AND `the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities`
              AND `the interests limb`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall be treated as held by the person providing the security— (a) where apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with his instructions, and (b) where the shares are held in connection with the granting of loans as part of normal business activities and apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in his interests" ("and" read as requiring both (a) and (b): fork; a "where" condition not met: ruling of 2026-11-05 (b))
    WHERE
        `the instructions limb` MEANS
                `apart from the right to exercise them for the purpose of preserving the value of the security, or of realising it, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of the person providing the security`
            OR  (`apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in accordance with the instructions of a group undertaking of the person providing the security` AND `sch 7 para 9(3) the rights are treated as exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of the undertaking` TRUE `s 1161(5) the undertaking is a group undertaking in relation to the other undertaking` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
        `the interests limb` MEANS
                `apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of the person providing the security`
            OR  (`apart from that right, the rights are exercisable only in the interests of a group undertaking of the person providing the security` AND `sch 7 para 9(3) the rights are treated as exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of the undertaking` TRUE `s 1161(5) the undertaking is a group undertaking in relation to the other undertaking` EQUALS JUST TRUE)

