-- src:19622 | (2) Nothing in paragraph 7 or 8 shall be construed as requiring rights held by a parent undertaking to be treated as held by any of its subsidiary undertakings.
@ref sch 7 para 9(2) Paragraphs 7 and 8 do not reach a parent undertaking's rights down to its subsidiaries (src:19622)
GIVEN `the rights are held by a parent undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person to whom paragraph 7 or 8 would attribute them is a subsidiary undertaking of that parent undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 7 para 9(2) paragraph 7 or 8 requires the rights held by the parent undertaking to be treated as held by its subsidiary undertaking` MEANS
    IF       `the rights are held by a parent undertaking`
         AND `the person to whom paragraph 7 or 8 would attribute them is a subsidiary undertaking of that parent undertaking`
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Nothing in paragraph 7 or 8 shall be construed as requiring rights held by a parent undertaking to be treated as held by any of its subsidiary undertakings"
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "rights held by a parent undertaking ... any of its subsidiary undertakings"

§§ `Disregard of certain rights (para 10) and supplementary (para 11)`

-- src:19625 | 10 The voting rights in an undertaking shall be reduced by any rights held by the undertaking itself.
@ref sch 7 para 10 The voting rights are reduced by the rights held by the undertaking itself (src:19625)
GIVEN `the voting rights in the undertaking` IS A NUMBER
      `the rights held by the undertaking itself` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`sch 7 para 10 the voting rights in the undertaking after the reduction` MEANS
    IF `the rights held by the undertaking itself` GREATER THAN `the voting rights in the undertaking`
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the undertaking cannot hold more of its own voting rights than there are
    ELSE JUST (`the voting rights in the undertaking` MINUS `the rights held by the undertaking itself`)

