§§ `One block of rights, seen from the parent undertaking (paras 5 to 11 together)`

-- A composition for the seat layer, as in Schedule 6. For ONE block of rights it says whether, after paragraphs 5 to 11, the block counts
-- as held by the parent undertaking. The inputs `the result of sch 7 para 5` and `the result of sch 7 para 8` are the answers of those
-- paragraphs above. The table (holder by capacity) is the Schedule's, one paragraph per cell, as the comments say.
